<title>USA: Hollywood group wants directors replaced.</title>
<headline>Hollywood group wants directors replaced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollywood Trenz Inc said Wednesday that its shareholder committee has begun soliciting proxies for replacement of the company's incumbent directors.</p>
<p>The company said the committee is seeking to replace the directors with its own proposed slate of directors.  </p>
<p>As of July 30, the four-member committee owned about 3.1 percent of the company's outstanding shares.  Committee member Eric Landis said this represents about 1,622,975 shares.</p>
